										"string" : "2. This installs a {{gtClass:TestExecutionEnvironment}} via {{gtMethod:DefaultExecutionEnvironment>>#runTestsBy:}} for all examples of the report. {{gtMethod:GtExamplesHudsonReport class>>#runPackage:}} creates one report per example class, so each class gets its own environment"
