											"__type" : "textStyle"
										},
										"string" : "4. {{gtMethod:GtExample>>#debug}} uses a {{gtClass:GtExampleDebugger}}, which runs the example managed. Since a test environment is already active, {{gtMethod:TestExecutionEnvironment>>#runExampleEvaluator:}} is called directly (no new environment created): each example runs under the watchdog and is cleaned up after it ends"
