														"__type" : "textStyle"
													},
													"string" : "The environment and its services (e.g. {{gtClass:ProcessMonitorTestService}}) are shared by all examples one report runs, i.e. the examples of one class. Services therefore have to be safe for use from several processes (see [[Patches/changes to the base Pharo Image]])."
												},
