														"__type" : "textStyle"
													},
													"string" : "An example that is started while another example or test is running gets its own environment ({{gtMethod:TestExecutionEnvironment>>#runNestedExampleEvaluator:}}), so that its clean up does not stop the processes, promises, and time limit of the running one."
