														"__type" : "textStyle"
													},
													"string" : "{{gtMethod:GtExamplesHudsonReport>>#runExample:}} retries a failing example up to three times. A failed attempt first unwinds ({{gtMethod:GtExamplesHudsonReport>>#runAttemptOf:isLastAttempt:addingStackTo:}}), so the environment marks the example as completed and the watchdog stops; only then {{gtMethod:GtExamplesHudsonReport>>#prepareForRetryOf:}} collects garbage and waits. See {{gtMethod:GtExamplesHudsonReportExamples>>#slowRetryOfTimedOutExampleIsReported}}."
												}
											]
